/P 165 0 R
/T (Before Christmas arrives, of course, we have a busy autumn ahead. October Half Term will see Horrible Histories return to Leeds Castle for a new Halloween adventure, followed by our annual Fireworks Spectacular in November.)
/E (Before Christmas arrives, of course, we have a busy autumn ahead. October Half Term will see Horrible Histories return to Leeds Castle for a new Halloween adventure, followed by our annual Fireworks Spectacular in November.)
