541 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 170 0 R
/T (Another hot summer and just like clockwork, we had another hosepipe ban to go with it. Water outages and hosepipe bans are becoming the new normal for us in Kent.)
/E (Another hot summer and just like clockwork, we had another hosepipe ban to go with it. Water outages and hosepipe bans are becoming the new normal for us in Kent.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
542 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 170 0 R
/T (Three times in the last year hundreds of my constituents were left without water for days on end.)
/E (Three times in the last year hundreds of my constituents were left without water for days on end.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
543 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 170 0 R
