/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 172 0 R
/E (Some time ago Bill Waters, a Church Army Captain, came from Derbyshire to Kingswood, bringing the idea of a Well Dressing here. It is common there, but we are possibly the only place in Kent to make such a decoration over the well, which would have been so important to inhabitants of the area 100 years ago.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [11]
>>
